 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 3.04,
   "end": 5.64,
   "text": "You tell the ghost of the old abbot about your long,"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.693,
   "end": 8.28,
   "text": "gruelling journey through the frozen wastes,"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.3,
   "end": 11.8,
   "text": "and explain that Firon advised you to ask Brother Jack for help."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.96,
   "end": 13.48,
   "text": "Jack nods slowly."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.312,
   "end": 16.36,
   "text": "\"I never dared hope that a fearless hero would"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.427,
   "end": 19.48,
   "text": "truly come to punish the Dark Lord for his atrocities."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.693,
   "end": 22.92,
   "text": "So my last dream has finally come true..."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.96,
   "end": 25.4,
   "text": "Our country has a long and tragic history."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.544,
   "end": 30.6,
   "text": "Only its rightful ruler can tell you the whole story: Richard, Firon's brother."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.747,
   "end": 36.2,
   "text": "After overthrowing him, the Dark Lord murdered him and divided his corpse in two."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.3,
   "end": 39.24,
   "text": "His body was laid in his tomb in the graveyard,"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.267,
   "end": 43.48,
   "text": "while his head was buried in the blocked tunnel of an old dwarven mine."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.156,
   "end": 47.244,
   "text": "Find both parts of our king's body and reunite them!"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.324,
   "end": 50.604,
   "text": "This is the only way to bring help to our land..."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.004,
   "end": 51.884,
   "text": "help..."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.051,
   "end": 52.531,
   "text": "hel...\""
  },
  {
   "start": 52.681,
   "end": 55.651,
   "text": "Wrapped in a cloud of bluish smoke,"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.691,
   "end": 60.611,
   "text": "Brother Jack's spirit returns to the realm of the dead, leaving you alone..."
  }
 ]
}
